Package: mbc26
Title: TCGA-BRCA Promoter-Methylation Screen for Progression-Free Interval
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Analysis project, not an installable package. This file lists
    the R packages the scripts in deployed_scripts_v1/ and test_mode/ load
    (plus R.utils, which data.table::fread needs for .gz input). renv.lock
    pins them and their dependencies; README.md, section Install, installs
    them.
